    - **P4.3 vox deploy platform target (OCI vs Fly vs Railway):** Recommends OCI as the universal substrate and Fly.io as the first-class wrapper, with Railway not adopted in v1.0. Evidence includes existing deploy targets enumeration (`vox-deploy-codegen/src/deploy_target.rs`) and Dockerfile generation (`vox-deploy-codegen::generate_dockerfile_from_spec`).
- The document provides detailed evidence, verdicts, reasoning, and sequencing for each decision, grounded in the current codebase.

